    AUTO-FARM SYSTEM - BLOX FRUIT STYLE (FIXED)
    - Direct CFrame movement (like Blox Fruit cheats)
    - Scans ALL models in dungeon for NPCs
    - Finds nearest NPC across all rooms
    - Spams abilities and weapon swing
    - Auto-hide when health below 50
    - Camera tracks NPC target
]]

